{"id": 131, "name": "Sora", "splash": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_40/100_8143d7bbd4318d7c699908e808de885e.png", "cls": ["Fighter", "Assassin"], "specialty": ["Charge", "Burst"], "difficulty": "50", "stats": ["60", "60", "50", "50"], "lanes": ["Exp Lane", ""], "story": "A pure and free-spirited boy with unshakeable resolve, drifting across the golden sands.", "skills": [{"name": "Mystic Surge", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_40/100_3612a82fab54424686631e59c7a8c322.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Sora can ascend to <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Thunder</span> or <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Torrent</span> by using his Ultimate. After ascending, dealing damage to heroes or summoned units grants 1 stack of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Cloudstep</span>. Upon reaching 5 stacks, he unlocks his True Art.\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Thunder</span>: Adopts an assassin style, converting 30% Max HP into Physical Attack (Equal to 10% of Max HP).\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Torrent</span>: Adopts a tank style, converting 30% Physical Attack into Max HP (Gains 10 HP for every 1 Attack)."}, {"name": "Sundering Strike", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_40/100_3e241dd044b166bccbc62957f2aaf0f8.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 5", "desc": "Sora strikes twice, dealing 140<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+50% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>, then lunges forward, dealing 240<span style=\"color:#26e407\"> (+5% Total HP)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>. He can dash after striking."}, {"name": "Windstride", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_40/100_14dbfe16a6a19c482ecc88eb0d9307a7.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 8", "desc": "Sora leaps forward, dealing 140<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+55% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>. If he hits an enemy hero or reaches max range, he slams the ground, dealing an additional 140<span style=\"color:#26e407\"> (+8% Total HP)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> and slowing them by 40% for 0.5s. Successful hits reduce the cooldown by 2s."}, {"name": "Shifting Skies", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_40/100_cea96e22851430931feb523f9bfac657.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 32", "desc": "Swipe left to ascend into <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Thunder</span> for 10s. Sora gains a brief bonus Movement Speed and becomes untargetable. He then summons lightning to strike nearby enemies 3 time(s), each dealing 140<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+50% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>.\n\nSwipe right to ascend into <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Torrent</span> for 10s. Sora gains Control Immunity. After a short delay, he pulls nearby enemies in and deals 250<span style=\"color:#26e407\"> (+8% Total HP)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>."}, {"name": "Mystic Surge", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_40/100_3612a82fab54424686631e59c7a8c322.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Sora can ascend to <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Thunder</span> or <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Torrent</span> by using his Ultimate. After ascending, dealing damage to heroes or summoned units grants 1 stack of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Cloudstep</span>. Upon reaching 5 stacks, he unlocks his True Art.\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Thunder</span>: Adopts an assassin style, converting 30% Max HP into Physical Attack (Equal to 10% of Max HP).\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Torrent</span>: Adopts a tank style, converting 30% Physical Attack into Max HP (Gains 10 HP for every 1 Attack)."}, {"name": "Sundering Strike - Thunderflash", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_40/100_e7981942a32da2499ed7ee5d955274bf.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 5", "desc": "Sora strikes four times, dealing 140<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+50% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>, then lunges forward, dealing 240<span style=\"color:#26e407\"> (+5% Total HP)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>. He can move freely during this skill."}, {"name": "Windstride - Thunder Rush", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_40/100_44c7378609f0dbc2cbc31eda36e1b41d.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 8", "desc": "Sora leaps forward, dealing 120<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+45% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>. Upon hitting a hero or reaching the max distance, he summons a thunderstorm, dealing 120<span style=\"color:#26e407\"> (+6% Total HP)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> and slowing enemies by 50% for 0.5s. This skill can be cast again within 4s if it hits an enemy."}, {"name": "Heaven's Wrath", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_40/100_7dd6e441e24c876f2a908d7bb23f91bb.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 0.2", "desc": "Sora leaps into the air and strikes a target area 16 time(s), dealing 60<s